# Security Requirements

This project contains extremely sensitive personal financial information.

Never commit:

- .env
- OAuth tokens
- Gmail credentials
- refresh tokens
- bank statements
- transaction databases
- portfolio data
- personal financial reports

Never request:

- UPI PIN
- bank password
- card CVV
- OTP
- trading password

Use read-only access wherever possible.

Financial MCP tools should be divided into:

READ:
- transactions
- balances
- investments
- portfolio
- reports
- market information

WRITE:
- local categorization
- local reports
- reconciliation metadata

HIGH RISK:
- money transfers
- trading
- SIP changes
- withdrawals
- payments

HIGH-RISK operations must require explicit user confirmation.

Do not expose full account numbers in reports.
Mask sensitive identifiers.
